chx:Research a res:ResearchProject ; rdfs:label "Making graphs and manipulating images for an advanced course: chapter 21 and today's Pillow, ImageDraw, pyperclipimg and Matplotlib"@en ;
    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts from the textbook ontology built over the published chapter. Then the official documentation for the current release and the PEPs the chapter's topics touch. Every source opened and read on 2026-10-13T13:30:00; every claim taken from text actually read; every behaviour executed under Python 3.14.6." ;
    res:hasResearchScope chx:Scope ; rdfs:member chx:P01, chx:P02, chx:P03, chx:P04, chx:P05, chx:P06, chx:P07, chx:P08, chx:P09, chx:P10, chx:P11, chx:P12, chx:P13, chx:P14, chx:P15, chx:P16, chx:P17, chx:P18, chx:P19, chx:P20, chx:P21, chx:P22, chx:P23, chx:P24, chx:P25, chx:P26, chx:P27, chx:P28, chx:P29, chx:P30, chx:P31, chx:P32, chx:P33, chx:P34, chx:P35, chx:P36, chx:P37, chx:P38, chx:P39, chx:P40, chx:P41, chx:P42, chx:P43, chx:P44, chx:P45, chx:P46, chx:P47, chx:P48, chx:P49, chx:P50, chx:P51, chx:P52, chx:P53, chx:P54, chx:P55, chx:P56, chx:P57, chx:P58, chx:P59, chx:P60 .
chx:Scope a res:ResearchScope ; res:hasResearchQuestion "What does chapter 21 of the 3rd edition teach about images with Pillow (colours, boxes, crop, paste, resize, rotate, transpose, pixels, a logo project, drawing, text and the clipboard) and about graphs with Matplotlib (line, scatter, bar, pie, labels, saving and showing), which of its printed outputs, listings and statements still hold under Python 3.14.6 with Pillow 12.3.0 and Matplotlib 3.11.2 and with the Pillow 10.4.0 and Matplotlib 3.9.2 that its Appendix A pins, and what must an advanced course correct or add so that it matches the Pillow releases, the Matplotlib backends and the files the book ships?" ; res:hasTimeWindow "Current as of 2026-10-13." .
